# "From anywhere": Bot2's Thoughtseize makes Bot1 discard Shock, a card put into a graveyard from a hand (CR 701.9a). The
# Void exiles it before anyone can use it, and exiles Thoughtseize itself as that spell leaves the stack. Bot1's hand
# keeps its other four cards (7 - Swamp - Void + the turn 3 draw - Swamp - Shock) and no graveyard holds a card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Planar Void
Shock
Mountain
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Thoughtseize
Swamp x4
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Planar Void.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Thoughtseize.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Shock)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Mountain; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Shock; Thoughtseize
Bot2.Life = 18
